{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やほ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おととい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなりんとずーっと行きたかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢の国！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/05/0003.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ディズニーのシーの方に行って来ました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃ楽しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上京してるのに二年間一度も行けなくて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーっと行こうね〜って約束してたから行けてよかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インディージョーンズのアトラクションが面白くて二回乗りましたヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また行こうね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハロウィンの時期に仮装して行きたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナルトの最新刊出てますね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん買いましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここら辺の展開は非常にドキドキします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やはり素晴らしいデスねっ！ヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帯に生駒がいます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"捨てた方もいると思いますが。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい帯に生駒がいます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えぇ帯に生駒がいます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帯に生駒がいますヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント書かせて頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分みたいなヤローがいいのでしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなマンガ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう日が来るなんて思いもしなかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日本屋さんに行って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に帯に乃木坂46のOP主題歌の文字と生駒を見つけて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢じゃなくて現実なんだと興奮して鼻血でる〜と思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャンプさんにも生駒コメント載せてもらっていて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャンプLIVEの企画で（皆さん見ましたか〜）集英社！ジャンプ編集部行けて興奮してキモい事言っちゃいそうになって（言ってたかも）必死に抑えてアイドルしてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神様ありがとうございますヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナルト大好きだから、やらせて頂くからには絶対壊さない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも頑張るぞー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかこんなに一気に嬉しい事続いたらあれじゃないかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか怖い事起こるんじゃないかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかマジで幸せからずどーんなんてないよねっ⁉"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうそればっかり最近！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドッキリじゃないよね⁈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現実だよね〜ヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファーファーファーファーファーファーファーファーファーファーファーファー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヽ(・∀・)ﾉヽ(・∀・)ﾉヽ(・∀・)ﾉヽ(・∀・)ﾉヽ(・∀・)ﾉヽ(・∀・)ﾉヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふっふーふっふーふっふープップー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー岡山県に行きたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へいへいへいへいへいへいへいへいへい平平平平平平平平兵平平平平兵！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/05/7092296/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/05/7092296/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すいまっせーん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つい興奮して変な方向に(；ω；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれなんですね。生駒は。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人間が必要な寝ること、食べること、トイレにいくことなど絶対に必要な動作の中に生駒はマンガを読むという事がプラスされたのですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんは何かこれだけは絶対必要だー！という物はありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非聞きたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで読んで下さってありがとうございました！(ノ∀；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/05/7092296/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！"}],"source":"archive"}